4. BUNDLED ASSETS
   Pictures, models and fonts that ship with the Software (splash screens,
   the butterfly model and texture, the demo project and others) are
   licensed only for use inside the Software and for viewing the demo. They
   may not be extracted and redistributed on their own, unless the file
   THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt says otherwise for that item. If You use a bundled
   asset inside Your Works (for example the butterfly primitive in a game),
   You may do so as part of Your Works.

5. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
